{"sha": "94f074f1fe6187794eb5a442806cf2dd72e9a8a9e52a28620cd890245b9a081e", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.25]", "  % splint test for oxygen", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {testtube={0}{white}};", "  \\draw[brown!60!black, line width=2pt] (0.15,1.6) -- (1.4,3.6);", "  \\fill[orange!85] (0.15,1.6) circle (0.07);", "  \\fill[orange!80] (0.12,1.62) .. controls (0.0,1.9) and (0.08,2.1) .. (0.1,2.3)", "    .. controls (0.2,2.05) and (0.3,1.85) .. (0.2,1.62);", "  \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-0.15) {氧气：\\\\ 带火星的木条\\\\ 复燃};", "  % pop test for hydrogen", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4cm]", "    \\pic[transform shape, rotate=180] at (0,3.1) {testtube={0}{white}};", "    \\draw[brown!60!black, line width=2pt] (0.05,-0.05) -- (1.3,-0.9);", "    \\fill[orange!85] (0.05,-0.02) .. controls (-0.05,0.08) and (0.0,0.15) .. (0.02,0.22)", "      .. controls (0.08,0.15) and (0.15,0.08) .. (0.1,-0.02);", "    \\node[font=\\small\\itshape] at (-0.9,0.15) {噗！};", "    \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-1.0) {氢气：\\\\ 尖锐的爆鸣声\\\\ 在管口};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：带火星的木条在氧气中复燃。右：点燃的木条", "靠近倒置盛有氢气的试管口，发出尖锐的“噗”声", "（氢气比空气轻，所以试管管口朝下放置。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{safety}{\\ghs[0.82cm]{GHS02}\\ghs[0.82cm]{GHS04}}", "% ledger: ghs:H2", "氢气：极易燃的气体（GHS02），以压缩状态储存在", "钢瓶中（GHS04）。做“噗”声试验时只用几毫升，", "由教师进行。", "\\end{safety}", "", "\\section{纸色谱法}", "", "\\begin{definition}[纸色谱法与色谱图]\\label{def:g7:identifying-substances:chromatography}", "\\emph{纸色谱法}\\index{纸色谱法}用于分离", "混合物中的染料。取少量混合物的斑点，点在距纸条底部", "附近画好的线上；将纸条底端浸入", "溶剂中，溶剂缓慢沿纸条上升，携带各种染料一同移动，", "其中有的染料移动较快。当溶剂上升至接近顶端时，", "取出纸条并晾干，所得即为", "\\emph{色谱图}\\index{色谱图}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.3]", "  % the strip in a beaker of solvent", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {beaker={0.12}{omWater!80}};", "  \\fill[white] (-0.42,0.06) rectangle (0.42,2.2);", "  \\fill[omWater!80] (-0.42,0.06) rectangle (0.42,0.24);", "  \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.6pt] (-0.42,0.06) rectangle (0.42,2.2);", "  \\draw[black!60, line width=0.4pt] (-0.42,0.42) -- (0.42,0.42);", "  \\fill[black!80] (0,0.42) circle (0.07);", "  \\shade[ball color=black!20] (0,2.27) circle (0.08);", "  \\draw[black!50, line width=1.2pt] (-1.1,2.27) -- (1.1,2.27);", "  \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-0.15) {开始时};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.1,0.5) -- (1.3,0.8) node[right, text=black]", "    {铅笔线上的墨迹};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (1.0,2.27) -- (1.3,2.5) node[right, text=black]", "    {固定纸条的玻璃棒};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.75,0.15) -- (1.3,0.25) node[right, text=black]", "    {溶剂，在线的下方};", "  % the chromatogram", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.2cm]", "    \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {tlcplate};", "    \\draw[black!50, dashed] (-0.7,2.7) -- (0.7,2.7);", "    \\fill[blue!70] (0,1.0) ellipse (0.13 and 0.09);", "    \\fill[red!70] (0,1.7) ellipse (0.13 and 0.09);", "    \\fill[yellow!80!orange] (0,2.35) ellipse (0.13 and 0.09);", "    \\node[anchor=north, align=center] at (0,-0.15) {色谱图};", "    \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.75,2.7) -- (1.3,2.85) node[right, text=black]", "      {溶剂上升的高度};", "    \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.2,1.7) -- (1.3,1.7) node[right, text=black]", "      {三种染料：墨水是混合物};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 黑色墨水的纸色谱。溶剂沿纸条上升，", "使墨水分离为三种染料。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[读取色谱图]\\label{met:g7:identifying-substances:read}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 数一数各起点上方的斑点：一个斑点说明为一种染料；", "        两个或更多斑点则为染料的混合物。", "  \\item 比较高度：同一色谱图中，同一种染料总是", "        上升到相同的高度。与已知染料处于同一高度的斑点，", "        很可能就是该种染料。", "  \\item 应使用铅笔画线，切勿用墨水：墨水本身也会", "        被溶剂分离。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[糖果中的染料]\\label{ex:g7:identifying-substances:sweets}", "取糖果的彩色糖衣，刮入少量水中，", "点在纸条上，旁边同时点上糖果中允许使用的食品染料。", "色谱图表明，绿色糖衣含有一种黄色染料和一种", "蓝色染料，两者都在允许使用的染料之中。", "\\end{example}", "", "", "\\section{阅读特征检验表}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[特征检验表]\\label{prop:g7:identifying-substances:bank}", "化学家把常用的检验方法整理成一张表，称为“检验表”，", "该表由左至右阅读：", "\\begin{center}", "\\small", "\\begin{tabular}{llll}", "\\hline", "所检测的化学物种 & 试剂或检验 & 阳性结果 & \\\\", "\\hline", "二氧化碳 & 石灰水 & 石灰水变浑浊 & \\\\", "水 & 无水硫酸铜 & 白色变为蓝色 & \\\\", "氧气 & 带火星的木条 & 木条复燃 & \\\\", "氢气 & 点燃的木条 & 尖锐的“噗”声 & \\\\", "混合物中的染料 & 纸色谱法 & 每种染料一个斑点 & \\\\", "\\hline", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}